('الصف الحادي عشر - صناعي','اللغة الإنجليزية','Unit 2: Education for success','Education for success','UNIT
Education for success
1 Look at the pictures. Then discuss the questions below in pairs or small groups.
What are the students doing in the pictures?
What impression do you get from the pictures?
